---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Hermes Agent Ops"
	description="We build and run practical AI-agent operations for businesses — not consulting decks, real running systems."
	pubDate={new Date('2026-05-15')}
>
	<h2>What We Do</h2>
	<p>
		Hermes Agent Ops installs and manages AI agents that handle the repetitive, time-sensitive
		parts of your business operations — starting with missed-lead recovery and working outward
		from there. We don't lead with technology. We lead with outcomes: recovered leads,
		completed follow-ups, and weekly numbers that prove it.
	</p>

	<h2>How We Operate</h2>
	<p>
		Every engagement starts with a scoped pilot workflow, usually a missed-lead recovery agent,
		so you can see real results before scaling. Once you have proof, we build out additional
		workflows — quote follow-up, appointment reminders, intake qualification — and manage them
		on an ongoing basis.
	</p>
	<p>
		You get a concise weekly report: how many inquiries came in, how many were recovered, how
		many booked or converted. No raw logs, no dashboards to learn. Just a clear summary and
		what to expect next week.
	</p>

	<h2>The Stack</h2>
	<p>Every workflow is built on a consistent, proven set of tools:</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Hermes Agent</strong> — the AI runtime that drives every workflow</li>
		<li><strong>Orgo</strong> — cloud computer layer for agent execution</li>
		<li><strong>Composio</strong> — OAuth, tool connections, and action layer</li>
		<li><strong>Agent Mail</strong> — dedicated inboxes for each agent workflow</li>
		<li><strong>Trello</strong> — sales and delivery pipeline visibility</li>
		<li><strong>Granola</strong> — call notes and implementation documentation</li>
		<li><strong>Loom</strong> — async demo and support videos</li>
		<li><strong>Obsidian</strong> — SOPs, prompt library, and knowledge base</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		Standardizing on this stack lets us move fast when adding new clients and keep operations
		consistent across every workflow we manage.
	</p>

	<h2>Who This Is For</h2>
	<p>
		We work best with owner-operated businesses that have a real lead volume — service
		businesses, trades, clinics, agencies — where a missed call or a slow follow-up costs real
		money. If your front desk is the bottleneck, or your owner is spending too much time on
		intake, Hermes Agent Ops closes that gap.
	</p>
</Layout>
